MiniMax-H3 MLX port
====================

This directory contains a copy of the upstream project

    minimax-h3-mlx
    https://github.com/PipeNetwork/minimax-h3-mlx

which is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The full license
text is in the LICENSE file next to this notice.

Modifications
-------------
The MLX Studio project (https://github.com/phoenix7956/mlx-studio) redistributed
this source tree with the following changes. Per section 4(b) of the Apache
License, the changed files are listed here:

  * minimax_h3_mlx/__init__.py   - added (empty package marker)
  * minimax_h3_mlx/adaln.py      - quantized nn.Linear has no `.weight`
                                    attribute; the dtype fallback now reads
                                    `.scales` when present.
  * minimax_h3_mlx/media.py      - added `find_ffmpeg()`, a locator that also
                                    checks ~/.ours/bin, the imageio-ffmpeg
                                    wheel and common Homebrew prefixes, so the
                                    pipeline works on machines without ffmpeg
                                    on PATH.
  * minimax_h3_mlx/pipeline.py   - added `ref_images` support (reference-image
                                    conditioning) and reporting of sequence
                                    length / width / height / frame count.

The `reference/`, `tests/` and some `scripts/` directories of the upstream
project are not part of this redistribution; they are only needed for
upstream's own parity testing and quantization evaluation.

